---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Refund & Cancellation Policy" updated="October 21, 2026">
  <p>
    This Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy applies to all purchases of <strong>Ekwly Pro</strong>
    (including the ₹49 7-Day Trip Pass, ₹99 Monthly Plan, and ₹799 Annual Plan) made through the
    Ekwly web application or mobile app.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Digital Delivery &amp; Instant Activation</h2>
  <p>
    Ekwly Pro is a purely digital software entitlement activated immediately upon payment capture.
    No physical shipment is involved.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Cancellation Policy</h2>
  <p>
    You may cancel a recurring Ekwly Pro subscription at any time. Upon cancellation, your account
    will retain full access to Ekwly Pro features until the end of your current paid billing period,
    after which it will automatically revert to the Free Forever tier without further charges.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Refund Eligibility</h2>
  <p>
    Because Ekwly incurs immediate cloud AI inference costs when Magic Scans are executed, refund
    eligibility is governed by usage during the current billing period:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Unused Monthly / Annual Subscriptions:</strong> If you request a refund within{' '}
      <strong>7 calendar days</strong> of payment and have not consumed any Pro AI Magic Scans
      during that billing cycle, we will issue a <strong>100% full refund</strong>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Duplicate Charges or Technical Failures:</strong> Any duplicate payment or verified
      technical failure where Pro access was not credited is eligible for an unconditional 100%
      refund.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Used Subscriptions &amp; 7-Day Trip Passes:</strong> Once Pro AI Magic Scans or
      Personal Analytics exports have been utilized during the active pass/cycle, the fee for that
      cycle is non-refundable.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Refund Processing Timeline</h2>
  <p>
    To request a refund, email <a href="mailto:lloy.dutta@gmail.com">lloy.dutta@gmail.com</a> with
    your registered Ekwly account email and payment receipt/UPI reference ID. Approved refunds are
    initiated within <strong>48 hours</strong> and are credited back to your original payment method
    (UPI, card, or bank account) within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong> as per Razorpay and
    RBI banking guidelines.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
